repository-code: https://github.com/turkananation/pqtransport
url: https://turkananation.github.io/pqtransport/
abstract: >-
  Pure-Dart post-quantum transport for Dart and Flutter: hybrid TLS 1.3
  (RFC 10024), encrypted UDP, DNS/DoH/DoT, mDNS, QUIC, and HTTP/1.1–3.
  Cryptography is package:pqforge; infrastructure is package:swissarmyknife.
keywords:
  - post-quantum cryptography
  - TLS 1.3
  - ML-KEM
  - Dart
license: MIT
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-09-17"
